# Testing

## Running tests

Prefer `make test` when the venv is active. Otherwise:

```bash
PYTHONPATH=. .venv/bin/python -m pytest tests/ -v
```

## Integration tests

Integration tests in `tests/integration/` may hit Questrade or other external services. They require:

- `.env` configured (see `config/.env.template`)
- Questrade token in `scripts/data/.questrade_token` or `QUESTRADE_REFRESH_TOKEN` for Questrade tests

Run unit-only tests when integration setup is not available:

```bash
make test-unit
```
